  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under IRC Section 465(e), if a taxpayer''s at-risk amount falls below zero, previously deducted losses must be recaptured as income. The nonrecourse loan with stop-loss protection reduces Donovan''s at-risk amount by $40,000 (from $15,000 to -$25,000), but recapture is limited to the $15,000 that brings at-risk to zero.
